From 4b4b0aaf01395514ff03de39dc932795c92ec2bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lukeponga-dev <lukeponga-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 01:36:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Refactor: introduce DI, fix HttpClient, add cancellation
 and error handling

- Add Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection + Http
- Centralize service registration in AppServices
- Use typed HttpClient for StremioClient (no socket exhaustion)
- Propagate exceptions instead of silent failure
- Add CancellationToken support to catalog/stream calls
- Remove custom ViewModelBase (use CommunityToolkit ObservableObject)
- Wire all pages/ViewModels through DI
- Improve nullability annotations on models
